DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: [APPA-033] Optimizer ignores personnel; CUT target 3-10x stretch ceiling in every team-game.\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF11"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-058", "score": 0.089, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-058 | Study family SF-APPA-058: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs\n- observed_research_question: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs\n- auto_outcome_status: rejected\n- observed_hypothesis: Each star's top sequential suppressor is stable across seasons, and some teammate X->Y sequences have large negative premiums.\n- observed_result: 2/30 (7%) stable (>=75% same top suppressor): D. Mitchell PUTBACK 75%, L. James POST_UP 75%. Negative: J. Tatum->K. Porzingis DRIVE->SPOT_UP -0.444 n=31; Giannis->Lillard DRIVE->PNR -0.263 n=31; J. Brown->J. Tatum SPOT_U [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Only 2/30 stars meet the 75% same-top-suppressor stability rule.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 30 stars x 4 seasons; min n=20/cell\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: null"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-052", "score": 0.08, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-052 | Study family SF-APPA-052: CUT feasibility cap: BEST-AVOID gap without CUT-heavy games\n- observed_research_question: CUT feasibility cap: BEST-AVOID gap without CUT-heavy games\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: The BEST vs AVOID gap is inflated by games where CUT exceeds 15% of H2 mix.\n- observed_result: All games BEST 1.473 vs AVOID 0.853 gap +0.620 MW p=0.0000 Spearman -0.316 n=2,544. CUT<=15%: +0.625 n=2,508. CUT>15%: +0.163 n.s. n=36. Only 4/272 games had CUT>15%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:BASE_RATE\n- observed_failure_evidence: Removing the 4 CUT-heavy games slightly strengthens the gap (+0.620 to +0.625).\n- observed_sample_and_power: 2,544 rows; 272 games\n- auto_validation_status: same_pipeline_validation; evidence: APPA-052: 'tale relative to n-gated +0.375 / best-vs-continue +0.445). robustness direction still holds on this csv. 2,544 rows; 272 game'\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF32\n- observed_verdict: supported\n- auto_confidence: high (1.0)"}], "n_results": 4}

