  }
 ],
 "evidence_establishes": [
  "A team-level regular-season-to-playoff comparison of play-type PPP (FAM:SF-APPS-011) recorded a DRIVE decline of about 0.29 points per possession. This is the only retrieved record that speaks to drive-heavy play transferring across contexts.",
